{"ref":"BDB, רְאָיָה","hw":"רְאָיָה","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">רְאָיָה</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. (</strong><span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> <em>hath seen</em><strong>)</strong>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  Judaite <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 4:2\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.4.2\">1 Ch 4:2</a> (Ραδα, A Ρεια, 𝔊L Ρεαα), = iii. <span dir=\"rtl\">הָרֹאֶה</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 2:52\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.2.52\">2:52</a> (crpt.; Αιω, A Αραα).<br><strong>2.</strong>  Reubenite <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 5:5\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.5.5\">1 Ch 5:5</a>, Ρηχα, 𝔊L Ραια.<br><strong>3.</strong>  post-ex. name <a data-ref=\"Ezra 2:47\" href=\"/Ezra.2.47\">Ezr 2:47</a> (Ρεηλ A 𝔊L Ραια) = <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 7:49\" href=\"/Nehemiah.7.49\">Ne 7:50</a> (Ραεα, A 𝔊L Ρααια).","next":"BDB, רְאוּבֵן","prev":"BDB, יִרְאִיָּיה"}